n-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Nishimori</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Tokino</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakamura</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Takai</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Localization of membrane-associated guanylate kinase (MAGI)-1&#x0002f;BAI-associated protein (BAP) 1 at tight junctions of epithelial cells</article-title><source>Oncogene</source><year>1999</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>7810</fpage><lpage>7815</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Oncogene||18|7810||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10618722</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jou</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name><name><surname>Nelson</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of regulated expression of mutant RhoA and Rac1 small GTPases on the development of epithelial (MDCK) cell polarity</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><year>1998</year><volume>142</volume><fpage>85</fpage><lpage>100</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Cell Biol||142|85||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9660865</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kaibuchi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuroda</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukata</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakagawa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regulation of cadherin-mediated cell&#x02013;cell adhesion by the Rho family GTPases</article-title><source>Curr Opin Cell Biol</source><year>1999</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>591</fpage><lpage>596</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Curr Opin Cell Biol||11|591||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10